sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Ingress
  participant Orch as Orchestration
  participant Queue as worker.jobs
  participant Worker as Execution
  participant Bus as SecureAgentBus
  participant Egress

  Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/engagements
  Ingress->>Orch: StartEngagement
  Orch->>Egress: status created
  Orch->>Queue: enqueue personas
  Queue->>Worker: RunWorkerJob
  Worker->>Bus: finding envelopes
  Worker->>Egress: job_finished
  Egress-->>Client: SSE stream
